Description: Xiatiao Player - GTK4 local music player with Rust audio backend
 Xiatiao Player (虾条播放器) is a local music player with a GTK4 interface
 and a Rust audio backend. It supports a wide range of formats, keeps the
 source sample rate without resampling, and provides a rich DSP chain
 (EQ/PEQ/loudness/limiter/etc.) via an embedded CamillaDSP.
 .
 Features:
  - Local library scan (mp3/flac/ape/wv/m4a/ogg/wav/dsf/dff)
  - Bit-perfect passthrough, sample-rate following (native PipeWire)
  - Embedded CamillaDSP with smooth parameter updates
  - Immersive full-screen page, lyrics, visualization
  - MPRIS2 and system tray support
